<!--
  Advenquo — NPC Spatial Dialogue Panel.
  Appears adjacent to interactive characters (Baba Adéwálé, Iyá Aláso)
  when the player approaches or selects them with their controller/hand ray.
  
  UIKit units are centimetres: 44cm wide. Faces +Z.
-->
<style>
  .root {
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 44;
    background-color: rgba(14, 20, 44, 0.95);
    border-radius: 1.4;
    border-width: 0.15;
    border-color: #f5d370;
  }

  .header {
    background-color: #1a237e;
    padding-top: 1.5;
    padding-bottom: 1.5;
    padding-left: 2;
    padding-right: 2;
    border-radius: 1.4;
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .speaker-info {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3;
  }

  .speaker-name {
    font-size: 2.2;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f5d370;
  }

  .speaker-role {
    font-size: 1.3;
    color: #90caf9;
  }

  .status-badge {
    background-color: rgba(245, 211, 112, 0.2);
    border-radius: 0.8;
    border-width: 0.1;
    border-color: #f5d370;
    padding-top: 0.5;
    padding-bottom: 0.5;
    padding-left: 1.2;
    padding-right: 1.2;
  }

  .status-text {
    font-size: 1.2;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #f5d370;
  }

  .body {
    padding-top: 1.8;
    padding-bottom: 1.8;
    padding-left: 2.2;
    padding-right: 2.2;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4;
  }

  .prompt-text {
    font-size: 1.7;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .choices-container {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1;
  }

  .choice-btn {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 1;
    border-width: 0.12;
    border-color: rgba(245, 211, 112, 0.5);
    padding-top: 1.2;
    padding-bottom: 1.2;
    padding-left: 1.5;
    padding-right: 1.5;
    flex-direction: column;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .choice-label {
    font-size: 1.45;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #e0f2fe;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .feedback-container {
    background-color: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.8);
    border-radius: 1;
    border-width: 0.12;
    border-color: #4a90d9;
    padding-top: 1.4;
    padding-bottom: 1.4;
    padding-left: 1.6;
    padding-right: 1.6;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1;
  }

  .feedback-text {
    font-size: 1.45;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .continue-btn {
    background-color: #f5d370;
    border-radius: 0.8;
    padding-top: 1;
    padding-bottom: 1;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .continue-label {
    font-size: 1.5;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a237e;
  }
</style>

<Panel class="root">
  <div class="header">
    <div class="speaker-info">
      <div id="npc-name" class="speaker-name">Baba Adéwálé</div>
      <div id="npc-role" class="speaker-role">Elder of the Courtyard</div>
    </div>
    <div class="status-badge">
      <div id="npc-badge" class="status-text">INTERACTION</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="body">
    <div id="npc-prompt" class="prompt-text">
      The morning sun is rising over the courtyard. How do you greet Baba Adéwálé respectfully?
    </div>

    <div id="npc-choices" class="choices-container">
      <div id="npc-choice-a" class="choice-btn">
        <div id="npc-choice-a-text" class="choice-label">A: Ẹ káàárọ̀ o, Baba! (Good morning, respected father!)</div>
      </div>
      <div id="npc-choice-b" class="choice-btn">
        <div id="npc-choice-b-text" class="choice-label">B: Báwo ni! (How are things!)</div>
      </div>
      <div id="npc-choice-c" class="choice-btn">
        <div id="npc-choice-c-text" class="choice-label">C: Good morning, sir. I have arrived.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="npc-feedback" class="feedback-container" style="display: none">
      <div id="npc-feedback-text" class="feedback-text">
        Correct! "Ẹ" denotes the plural of respect (honorific register), acknowledging the elder's seniority.
      </div>
      <div id="npc-continue-btn" class="continue-btn">
        <div class="continue-label">Continue</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Panel>
